                        "arabic_name": "وَمَا نَقَمُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ إِلَّآ أَن يُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَمِيدِ",
                        "translated_name": "They had no other reason for hating them except that they believed in God the mighty, worthy of praise,"
