                        "chapter_id": 85,
                        "verses_translate_name": "Verses",
                        "verses_number": "9",
                        "arabic_name": "ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدٌ",
                        "translated_name": "Whose kingdom spreads over the heavens and the earth. God is witness over everything."
